BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Bay/Free] United Nations Association Film Festival in Palo Alto (
 Oct. 15-25)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T210000
DTSTAMP:20261010T115159Z
UID:funcheap-20261015-unitednationsassociation
CATEGORIES:community,free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/united-nations-association-film-festiv
 al-palo-alto-oct-1525/\nLocation: san francisco\nPrice: Free\nCategories: 
 community\, free\nSource: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nThe United Nations Ass
 ociation Film Festival (UNAFF) is pleased to announce the program for its 
 29th edition\, PASSION FOR CHANGE. From Oct. 15–25\, 2026 \, in Palo Alt
 o\, East Palo Alto\, San Francisco and at Stanford University\, UNAFF will
  present 60 global documentary films. Students are encouraged to attend th
 e festival and may receive free tickets to films with a valid student ID. 
 For more information\, contact us at info@unaff.org SESSIONS As documentar
 ies come in different lengths\, it is impractical to sell tickets for indi
 vidual films. Instead\, we group multiple films into SESSIONS \, trying to
  combine them loosely by topic so that together they make for a generous v
 iewing experience. So\, if you are interested in a particular film\, find 
 its session number and purchase the ticket for that session. FESTIVAL PASS
 ES The best deal is to purchase a FESTIVAL PASS \, which allows access to 
 all the festival screenings and events during the 11 days of the festival 
 \, and if you are a senior\, you can save even more by taking advantage of
  our deeply discounted SENIOR FESTIVAL PASS . ADMISSION GENERAL ADMISSION 
 – $1 9 PER FILM SESSION (1.5 – 3 hours per session) FESTIVAL PASS – 
 $2 9 0 SENIOR FES
LOCATION:san francisco
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/united-nations-association-film-festival-palo-
 alto-oct-1525/
END:VEVENT
