  6 blocks\, 3 public plazas\, 1 Night Only! Market Street transforms into 
 a walkable arts spectacle. Free public performances\, ticketed shows at ic
 onic venues\, and tons of sensational things to see and do. Uniting iconic
  independent venues\, beloved homegrown artists\, and our landmark theater
 s\, this festival is as bold\, eclectic\, and singular as San Francisco it
 self. The festival kicks off at 4pm in UN Plaza with Dear San Francisco \,
  BANDALOOP \, and SF’s first ever Drag Laureate\, D’Arcy Drollinger of
  OASIS. Market Street Arts & Theater Festival Saturday\, October 17\, 2026
  | 4p – 10p Market Street between 5th & Van Ness\, SF FREE | RSVP Recomm
 ended\; first 500 RSVPs get a $20 voucher for food at participating venues
  Experiences include: Dear San Francisco \, Circus Bella \, Spectrum Theat
 er and The People’s Circus at the UN Plaza stage BANDALOOP Vertical Danc
 ers DJ Mark Farina with Monarch at The Market ACT’s Young Conservatory C
 abaret Drag Queen Show Tune Sing Along with Curveball at the Orpheum Theat
 re Sunroom Skywatcher
